  - id: vessels_of_gold_and_earth
    displayName: Vessels of Gold and Earth
    flavorText: Paul warns Timothy to shun profane babblings and purge himself from
      dishonorable influence, so he may be a vessel of honour, sanctified and meet
      for the Master's use.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Teaches Timothy how to guard sound doctrine against corrosive false
      teaching -- using Hymenaeus and Philetus as the concrete negative example --
      and how personal purity determines a person's usefulness to the Master, likened
      to a vessel of gold, silver, wood, or earth within a great house.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_2timothy
    managerId: vessels_of_the_house_2timothy
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 1449.1376746189437
