  - id: the_inspired_scripture
    displayName: The Inspired Scripture
    flavorText: Paul declares that all scripture is given by inspiration of God and
      is profitable for doctrine, reproof, correction, and instruction, so the man
      of God may be thoroughly equipped for every good work.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Establishes the divine origin, trustworthiness, and practical sufficiency
      of scripture itself for teaching, reproof, correction, and instruction, so
      that the man of God may be complete and thoroughly equipped for every good
      work.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_2timothy
    managerId: inspired_scripture_2timothy
