  - id: preach_the_word
    displayName: Preach the Word
    flavorText: Paul solemnly charges Timothy before God and Christ Jesus to preach
      the word in season and out of season, reproving, rebuking, and exhorting with
      all longsuffering and doctrine.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Paul's final, most solemn commission to Timothy for gospel ministry,
      anticipating a coming era of doctrinal drift among hearers and instructing
      him to remain steady in the work regardless.
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_2timothy
